WEBVTT

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.016
it's what makes us strong.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.776
It's not that we're better than men,

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.848
we just don't have
our masculinity to prove.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:07.656
LT: And, well --

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.336
JF: That's a Gloria Steinem quote.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.736
So we can express our humanity --
LT: I know who Gloria Steinem is.

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:15.237
JF: I know you know who she is,
but I think it's a --

00:11:15.261 --> 00:11:17.296
(Laughter)

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.176
No, but it's a great quote, I think.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:23.456
We're not better than men, we just
don't have our masculinity to prove.

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:24.856
And that's really important.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:27.456
LT: But men are
so inculcated in the culture

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:30.616
to be comfortable in the patriarchy.